  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "是<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F0010000201000000554A3002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "竟然在一家團聚的時候出現，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳還真是個不識趣的傢伙。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7ADF713657284E005BB65718805A76846642501951FA73FEFF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B39084771F662F500B4E0D8B588DA3768450A24F19300200100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "才不是咧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "624D4E0D662F54A73002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請等一下！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n每次都是<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>出風頭……\n我也有想說的事情！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7B494E004E0BFF0100100001BE01000A6BCF6B2190FD662F001000020100000051FA98A8982D20262026000A62114E5F670960F38AAA76844E8B60C5FF01001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以請讓我和\n來電伍的兩位一決勝負吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE58ACB8B936211548C000A4F8696FB4F0D768451694F4D4E006C7A52DD8CA05427FF01001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>願意的話，\n陪你們玩玩我是沒差啦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000009858610F76848A71FF0C000A966A4F60501173A973A96211662F6C925DEE55663002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "來吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F865427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "下次再說",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0B6B21518D8AAA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳有時候\n會總之先選擇拒絕呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100003110000FF01014F6059B3670966425019000A67037E3D4E4B5148907864C762D27D5554623002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要有頭巾混混牠們在就一定能贏！\n不對，我們會贏的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA89816709982D5DFE6DF76DF77260501157285C314E005B9A80FD8D0FFF01000A4E0D5C0DFF0C6211501167038D0F7684FF01001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在這裡的我，不論是\n什麼樣的卡友都歡迎放馬過來。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5728901988E176846211FF0C4E0D8AD6662F000A4EC09EBC6A237684536153CB90FD6B618FCE653E99AC904E4F863002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我實際上也算是卡娜莉了。\n能和兩個卡娜莉對戰，簡直是賺到了吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115BE6969B4E0A4E5F7B97662F53615A1C83894E863002000A80FD548C5169500B53615A1C83895C0D6230FF0C7C2176F4662F8CFA52304E865427300200100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "來對戰吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F865C0D62305427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請等等",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7B497B490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喂，來對戰啦！\n機會難得啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5582FF0C4F865C0D62305566FF01000A6A5F670396E35F97554A3002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我就跟你們交交手，\n但勝利會是我的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115C318DDF4F6050114EA44EA4624BFF0C000A4F4652DD52296703662F62117684FF01001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳是想做什麼啊？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3662F60F3505A4EC09EBC554AFF1F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是我們贏了，\n就要你們來幫忙做卡娜莉麵包！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F621150118D0F4E86FF0C000A5C3189814F6050114F865E6B5FD9505A53615A1C83899EB55305FF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "趕快讓我對戰吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D955FEB8B9362115C0D623054273002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這回我要真正地認真啦！\n用超級進化一飛衝天吧，麻麻鰻魚王！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901956DE62118981771F6B6357308A8D771F5566FF01000A75288D857D1A903253164E0098DB885D59295427FF0C9EBB9EBB9C3B9B5A738BFF01001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了實現我的策略，\n超級進化吧，龍頭地鼠！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E865BE673FE621176847B567565FF0C000A8D857D1A903253165427FF0C9F8D982D57309F20FF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "頭巾混混！我會好好發揮\n你超級進化後的力量的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "982D5DFE6DF76DF7FF0162116703597D597D767C63EE000A4F608D857D1A903253165F8C7684529B91CF76843002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們贏了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621150118D0F4E86FF01001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這位卡友，\n你想說的是什麼？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194F4D536153CBFF0C000A4F6060F38AAA7684662F4EC09EBCFF1F001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有一天我一定會設計出讓\n卡娜莉小姐願意穿上的衣服！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094E00592962114E005B9A67038A2D8A0851FA8B93000A53615A1C83895C0F59D09858610F7A7F4E0A76848863670DFF01001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒問題，\n如果是讓我中意的設計。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C92554F984CFF0C000A5982679C662F8B9362114E2D610F76848A2D8A083002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也給我一套吧！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n為了了解卡娜莉的心情，\n我需要跟她打扮得一樣才行！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F7D6662114E0059575427FF0100100001BE01000A70BA4E864E8689E353615A1C838976845FC360C5FF0C000A6211970089818DDF59796253626E5F974E006A23624D884CFF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "才不需要～<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "624D4E0D97008981FF5E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，來，\n這個給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C4F86FF0C000A9019500B7D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B33002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>獲得了\n卡娜莉裝扮服飾組合！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000073725F974E86000A53615A1C838988DD626E670D98FE7D445408FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我就送你這個吧。\n爺爺做的卡娜莉麵包！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115C3190014F609019500B54273002000A723A723A505A768453615A1C83899EB55305FF01001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "卡娜莉麵包……\n我會一輩子好好珍惜的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53615A1C83899EB5530520262026000A621167034E008F295B50597D597D73CD60DC7684FF01001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呃，你吃掉吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5443FF0C4F605403638954273002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "話說回來，還真贏不了<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>呢。\n麻麻鰻魚王牠們明明也做了很多鍛鍊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A718AAA56DE4F86FF0C9084771F8D0F4E0D4E86001000020100000054623002000A9EBB9EBB9C3B9B5A738B72605011660E660E4E5F505A4E865F88591A935B934A3002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "卡娜莉麵包大受歡迎。\n我正在考慮要不要在各地開店！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53615A1C83899EB55305592753D76B618FCE3002000A62116B6357288003616E89814E0D8981572854045730958B5E97FF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然重要的是在現實世界中也傳達我的心願，\n總有一天……我會加油的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 1948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D6713691CD89817684662F572873FE5BE64E16754C4E2D4E5F50B39054621176845FC39858FF0C000A7E3D67094E005929202620266211670352A06CB976843002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    }
  ],
